# SCPN Theta Pinch Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN Theta Pinch Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the theta-pinch configuration
  within the SCPN Reactor Systems Research Group. Evidence maturity
  computational_prototype: a validated device configuration model,
  diagnostic and clock semantics aligned with the SCPN Phase Orchestrator
  observability catalogue, level-0 device physics (the sharp-boundary
  relations of the Scyllac review: operating state, toroidal equilibrium,
  m = 1 growth with wall stabilisation and end-loss scaling), and
  tessellated and B-rep device models with STL, glTF and STEP exports. All
  parameter sets are synthetic; no real machine is described, and the claim
  inventory is empty.
